       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-QUANTUM-ANNEAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-QUANTUM-ANNEAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-ISING-TRANSVERSE-SPIN-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TUNNELING-PASSAGE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ADIABATIC-GAP-SOUNDNESS  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-GROUND-RESONANCE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BOLTZMANN-SPIN-EQUILIB   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-QUANTUM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-QUANTUM-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-QUANTUM-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ISING-AND-TUNNELING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ADIABATIC-GAP.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-GROUND-RESONANCE.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-QUANTUM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-ISING-AND-TUNNELING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ISING-TRANSVERSE-SPIN-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TUNNELING-PASSAGE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ADIABATIC-GAP.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ADIABATIC-GAP-SOUNDNESS.
       3000-EVALUATE-GROUND-RESONANCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-GROUND-RESONANCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BOLTZMANN-SPIN-EQUILIB.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-QUANTUM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-ISING-TRANSVERSE-SPIN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TUNNELING-PASSAGE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ADIABATIC-GAP-SOUNDNESS = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-GROUND-RESONANCE = 1 AND
              WS-BOLTZMANN-SPIN-EQUILIB = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-QUANTUM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-QUANTUM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-QUANTUM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-QUANTUM-CODE.
